WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:06.118
The player tells you what happens: start, pause, finish, and any problem.

2
00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:13.309
Callbacks sit next to the file. When the intro finishes, the page moves on.

3
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:44.848
Problems arrive the same way. A broken effect is a warning: it still plays. A missing file is an error: it will not. Each has a code, and says who can fix it.

4
00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:15.285
Handle them in code, and the console stays quiet.
